    <innerclass refid="class_m_q_t_t_manager" prot="public">MQTTManager</innerclass>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Basic MQTT Manager for temperature controller with HiveMQ Cloud connection. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>Claude Assistant </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>2025-01-27</para>
</simplesect>
This class provides basic MQTT functionality with hardcoded HiveMQ Cloud credentials and topics. It includes connection management, auto-reconnect, and message subscription capabilities with verbose debug output. </para>
